Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-dbus, python3-gi, polkitd, pkexec, unattended-upgrades, libnotify-bin, systemd, apt, dpkg (>= 1.17.2), fabos-branding
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ Updates — check/install updates, Standard or Beta channel, automatic updates
 One place for @DISTRO_NAME@ and Ubuntu updates: a Check/Install app, a twice-daily
 check that notifies logged-in users from inside their session, release channels
 (Standard = suite @DISTRO_CODENAME@, Beta = @DISTRO_CODENAME@-beta), unattended-upgrades
 configured for both the @VENDOR_NAME@ repository and Ubuntu security, and the
 post-upgrade follow-up (dpkg trigger fabos-postupgrade): records what changed,
 restarts the idle agent/voice user services, tells the user whether to log out
 and back in or restart. Never restarts the desktop session by itself.
